\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Layered architecture. Solid arrows are calls; dashed arrows are ``implements'', ``depends on interface'' or dependency injection. \texttt  {ImageManagementService} runs the validation and anonymisation stages and \texttt  {PreprocessingService} the quality and normalisation stages of the same \texttt  {AIPipeline}. Services only see the abstract interfaces of the domain layer; the composition root (\texttt  {main.py}) wires concrete repositories, storage and registry into them. The model artefact lives in \texttt  {/app/models}, outside the persistent data volume.}}{10}{figure.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:architecture}{{1}{10}{Layered architecture. Solid arrows are calls; dashed arrows are ``implements'', ``depends on interface'' or dependency injection. \texttt {ImageManagementService} runs the validation and anonymisation stages and \texttt {PreprocessingService} the quality and normalisation stages of the same \texttt {AIPipeline}. Services only see the abstract interfaces of the domain layer; the composition root (\texttt {main.py}) wires concrete repositories, storage and registry into them. The model artefact lives in \texttt {/app/models}, outside the persistent data volume}{figure.caption.4}{}}
